                                "sense_id": "4ed63d6a-d50a-337e-aa11-0f699ec254ce",
                                "text": "Adidas presents a new line of sleek forward-looking clothes at midrange prices, invigorating slumpy SoHo in the process."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "07f6d867-980d-3fba-a9a2-bf8e87ae14cd",
                        "entry_id": "81ee78d0-63da-33af-b799-c5602af6f016",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Slumping or sagging, or tending to slump or sag."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "informal"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "9f6d236b-fc98-4d6e-93f7-efc5ea1860e0",
                                "sense_id": "07f6d867-980d-3fba-a9a2-bf8e87ae14cd",
                                "text": "Someone put together a clean-lined, benignly elegant chair's chair — shaped somewhat like a midcentury desk chair, only slumpier."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "bc50e520-5ba9-4852-a2dd-61369afbc30a",
                                "sense_id": "07f6d867-980d-3fba-a9a2-bf8e87ae14cd",
                                "text": "Phillip Alale, although his posture was slumpy, kept on loudly protesting his innocence."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "273748cd-9bad-45b3-93e0-4ad8c13d0725",
                                "sense_id": "07f6d867-980d-3fba-a9a2-bf8e87ae14cd",
                                "text": "Slumpy shoulders went square, back went ramrod straight, and she smiled at the other woman."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "b808f187-fa1e-3c6e-b02d-9ea0d0671c33",
                        "entry_id": "81ee78d0-63da-33af-b799-c5602af6f016",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Easily broken through; boggy; marshy."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "UK",
                            "US",
                            "dialectal"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "ce95c919-29e3-4d42-9da6-80b72fe702fa",
                                "sense_id": "b808f187-fa1e-3c6e-b02d-9ea0d0671c33",
                                "text": "So away goes lunch, and off goes you and the 'Sir,' a trampousin' and trapsein' over the wet grass agin […] and then back by another path that's slumpier than t'other, and twice as long […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4dc6ea9b-8b18-4791-a430-167a8ff5db1d",
                                "sense_id": "b808f187-fa1e-3c6e-b02d-9ea0d0671c33",
                                "text": "[…] a large extent of rushy ground, either dry or hard, or slumpy and wet, […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "deb4489c-1f95-45bb-bb92-7bf3dd918990",
                                "sense_id": "b808f187-fa1e-3c6e-b02d-9ea0d0671c33",
                                "text": "[…] making a rock his easy-chair, and a pair of hunting-boots his slippers; letting his dressing-gown be a woollen shirt or an india-rubber overcoat; finding his dainty, creamy-leaved books in white birch trees, or yeasty, frothy, river-rapids, and for delicate annotations making big tracts through the slumpy alluvion of the forest[…]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "657967ef-0a66-45a1-9425-5d473675a35b",
                                "sense_id": "b808f187-fa1e-3c6e-b02d-9ea0d0671c33",
                                "text": "The softening of the great body of snow renders the roads slumpy and full of \"Thank-ye-ma'ams,\" so that sleighing is not altogether a blissful experience just now."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
